{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ遅くなってごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに、東京はプリンシパル終わりましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長かったようであっというまでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも学校との両立が大変で......\nどっちも覚えることいっぱいで...\nセリフ覚えてないとmemberに迷惑かけちゃうし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校も次々と進んでいくからついていくのが大変で..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"精神的にも肉体的にもキツくて......\n途中胃薬を飲んだりしてました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも最後迄やる事が出来たのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログでの皆からのコメントで沢山の勇気をもらい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーやスタッフさん達に支えてもらって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演中も声援聞こえました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タオルや団扇も"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってる人の顔も見えました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選んでもらえるとは思ってなかったので、凄くビックリしたし嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまだまだなので頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今は達成感でいっぱいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなふうに思わせてくれた事に感謝してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの人達が\n『プリンシパル見に行きましたよー！頑張ってください！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと声をかけてくださり、嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大坂公演も沢山の人達に来て良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これない方も応援して良かった！\n知らない方も、乃木坂をもっと応援したい！って思ってもらえるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力！感謝！笑顔！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で頑張りたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京公演は\nみなみ♪ユッキーナ♪せっちゃん♪\nそーしーてー!!ゆみ姉!!が来てくれて嬉しかったです(T^T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのお姉ちゃんの美雲ちゃんもいたら最高だったけど、でも気持ちはいつも一緒です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだよね〜美雲ちゃん〜♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"設楽さんや日村さん、いとださんに、\nとっても可愛いまゆゆさんも来てくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のお花の中にfamilyさんからのお花がありました♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生も沢山増えて、これからもっともっと成長していきたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪公演もはりきっていきたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも体調を気にしてくれてありがとう♪\nまあやは元気です!!\n朝起きるのが眠いけど...笑\n学校、レッスン、等々"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆も頑張ってると思うと力が沸いてくるから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では勉強して寝ます〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆も元気で笑顔でありますように..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/14/3770800/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}